@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@auth = {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth

### Login — valid (admin). Copy "accessToken" from the response into @token below.
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

# Paste the accessToken from the login response above (no quotes, no "Bearer" prefix).
# VS's .http editor has no request variables, so this step is manual.
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJhdWQiOiJoZWxwZGVzay1jbGllbnQiLCJpc3MiOiJoZWxwZGVzay1hcGkiLCJleHAiOjE3ODg0NzYzMzYsInN1YiI6InVzcl9hZG1pbiIsImVtYWlsIjoiYWRtaW5AZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJodHRwOi8vc2NoZW1hcy5taWNyb3NvZnQuY29tL3dzLzIwMDgvMDYvaWRlbnRpdHkvY2xhaW1zL3JvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODQ3NDUzNiwibmJmIjoxNzg4NDc0NTM2fQ.f-nzBXeoAN6jUB5vqr2JxJOnmVtcV7H_TJUqYMOuWeg

### Me — with the token (should return admin's id/name/email/role)
GET {{auth}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Me — WITHOUT a token (401 ProblemDetails: type/title/status/detail/requestId)
GET {{auth}}/me
Accept: application/json

###

### Me — garbage token (401 ProblemDetails, same shape)
GET {{auth}}/me
Authorization: Bearer this.is.garbage
Accept: application/json

###

### Login — wrong password (401, generic message)
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

###

### Login — unknown email (401, byte-identical body to wrong password)
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Login — malformed email (400 validation, not 401)
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "x"
}

###

### Login as moderator
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sam@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Login as user
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jordan@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Logout — revokes refresh tokens (204)
POST {{auth}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
